message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Healthcare UC Automation: open-source E911 reconciliation for healthcare Cisco UC"
abstract: >-
  Open-source tooling and methodology for RAY BAUM's Act dispatchable-location
  compliance in healthcare unified communications. The E911 reconciliation engine
  continuously verifies that each phone's 911 location matches the facility's
  physical cable-plant records by comparing the location database, switch
  discovery, Cisco Emergency Responder and CUCM, and keeps an append-only audit
  history of location accuracy.
type: software
